    {
      "fileName": "strategist-stance.json",
      "id": "fJwsZM6WXwP8EStV",
      "name": "Strategist Stance",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "fJwsZM6WXwP8EStV",
        "folder": "Ji2CbKYOXGa69X7A",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Strategist Stance",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You find the most strategic options for you and your allies. When you use this action, attempt a @Check[society|dc:@self.level|roller:self] or @Check[warfare-lore|dc:@self.level|roller:self] check. The DC is usually a standard-difficulty DC of your level, but the GM can assign a different DC based on the circumstances.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Stance: Strategist Stance]</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Your marshal's aura increases to a @Template[type:emanation|distance:20], and it grants you and allies a +1 status bonus to Reflex saving throws. Once per turn, when you succeed or critically succeed at a Recall Knowledge check to gain information about an enemy creature, the target of the Recall Knowledge check becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to the next attack made against it by you or an ally in your aura.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As critical success, but your aura's size doesn't increase.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You fail to enter the stance.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> You fail to enter the stance and can't take this action again for 1 minute.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Marshal Dedication"
              },
              {
                "value": "trained in Society or Warfare Lore"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype",
              "stance"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 4,
      "category": "class"
    },
